TitanOS – Third-Party Components
================================

TitanOS's own code is licensed under FSL-1.1-ALv2 (see LICENSE.md).
The system image also contains third-party software that keeps its own
license. This file is generated by the release pipeline from the Debian
package metadata and the frontend/backend dependency lists, and is shown
in the web UI under "Settings > About".

Until the first release this file lists the planned main components only.

